     "**Rejection sampling.** Keep only traces that the grader marks right, that were **not cut off** (drop `finish_reason == \"length\"`: a cut-off trace teaches \"never finish\"), at most 2 per question, without duplicates. The script prints how many questions the teacher solved never, sometimes and always. The \"never\" questions **vanish** from the training set, and they are exactly the hardest ones (B2).",
